        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_real_world_especially_robotics_those",
          "text": "In the real world, especially in robotics, those resets are expensive, requiring human supervision or scripted routines. This work, presented at ICML 2023 by Jigang Kim, Daesol Cho, and H.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "real",
