          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s06_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c1_test_ibc_authors_assembled_six",
          "text": "To test IBC, the authors assembled six sparse-reward environments spanning both manipulation and locomotion. Two of them, Tabletop Manipulation and Sawyer Door, come from EARL, an established benchmark for autonomous reinforcement learning.",
