          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_headline_result_ibc_reaches_state_of",
          "text": "The headline result is that IBC reaches state-of-the-art success rates across all six environments, and it does so without a single demonstration.",
          "expected_role": "method",
