          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_demonstration_based_baselines_especi",
          "text": "The demonstration-based baselines especially falter in the Fetch environments, where the task-relevant interactions are sparse and the evaluation goals are spread across a whole region rather than a few discrete points.",
