          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c1_ablation_study_peels_method_apart",
          "text": "The ablation study peels the method apart to show that both pieces earn their keep. First, removing the bidirectional curriculum causes a consistent drop in performance, demonstrating the value of gradually guiding the agent from easy initial states and goals to harder ones.",
