          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c2_further_removing_auxiliary_agent_whi",
          "text": "Then, further removing the auxiliary agent, which reduces the method to naive reset-free reinforcement learning, causes an additional and larger drop, particularly in the object-manipulation tasks.",
